# Target: .github/CODEOWNERS
#
# The shared set is the escape hatches, the files that grant exemptions, not
# the whole tree, so code-owner review gates exemptions rather than every PR. A
# line for a hatch the repo lacks still works: a PR creating it needs the owner.
/.standardsignore        @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/.standards.mode         @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/.docs-lint*             @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/tools/floors.tsv        @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/.github/                @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
